  "description": "Middle school MVP. A spot on the U16 national team. The future was bright for Jun, until his father’s brutal crime branded him the son of a criminal. Amid public backlash and pressure, Jun finds solace in basketball, pouring himself into the game he loves to hone his skills and escape the weight of his troubles. Now, as the captain of Yeomyeong High, he must rally his teammates to glory and carve out his own future in the world of basketball, free from the dark past that once threatened to take everything from him.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
